municable diseases (NCDs), their screening (beneficiaries, methods and frequency) and community based assessment checklist-Understands signs of healthy mouth changes in various age groups, common oral diseases (including Fluorosis), emergency conditions and various side effects of tobaco consuption-Understands various iodine deficinency disorders, importance of cunsumption of iodised salt-Understands importance of mental health, common mental disorders\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"विभिन्न बीमारियों, उनके लक्षणों और उनकी जटिलताओं के बारे में समझना\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"विभिन्न बीमारियों, उनके लक्षणों और उनकी जटिलताओं के बारे में समझना\"},{\"level\":\"2\",\"name\":\"Understands contact tracing and screening\",\"description\":\"Understands pre and post screening test(i.e. Rapid Test) and follow up counselling-Understands contact tracing, directly Observed Treatment (Dots) and follow up counselling for NTEP/RNTCP-Understands suspect cases and Multi Drug Therapy (MDT) and follow up counseling for leprosy-Understands collection of blood slides , Rapid Diagnostic Test and follow up counseling for vector borne diseases-Understands preventive measures, various services provided under NPPCD and NPCB&VI and possible complications post rehabilitation treatment-Understands treatment of various NCDs, their complications, follow up counselling and NCD Card-Understands signs and symptoms of various oral diseases, pre referal treatment and preventive measures-Understands screening of various iodine deficiency disorders, preventive measures and testing of salt for iodine level-Understands various services provided under national mental health program and recording and mentainance of data\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग को समझना\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग को समझना\"},{\"level\":\"3\",\"name\":\"Conducts contact tracing and screening\",\"description\":\"Conducts pre and post screening and and follow up counselling and maintain a com