 measures, cessation of tobaco consumption etc-Educates community members and patients for preventive measures for iodine deficiency disorders-Educates community members and patients over importance of mental health, services provided under NMHP\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"सहकर्मियों और समुदाय के सदस्यों के बीच जागरूकता फैलाना\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"सहकर्मियों और समुदाय के सदस्यों के बीच जागरूकता फैलाना\"},{\"level\":\"5\",\"name\":\"Evaluates the condition of the patient\",\"description\":\"Assists doctors as and when required and provide referrals to clients with HIV/AIDS-Refer to higher facility in case of any complication for patients with leprosy-Refer to higher facility in case of any complication for patients with TB-Refer to higher facility in case of any complication for patients of VBD-Refers to higher facility in case of any complication in patients post rehabilitation treatment for blindness and deafness-Refer to higher facility in case of any complication for patients of NCD-Provides pre-referal management, refer to higher facility in case of any complications/emergency for iron deficieny disorders -Provide pre-referal management, refer to higher facility in case of any complications/emergency for patients with oral hygiene issues-Follows up with mental disorder patients under rehabilitation treatment and referal if required\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"रोगी की स्थिति का मूल्यांकन करना\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"रोगी की स्थिति का मूल्यांकन करना\"}]","raw":"\"[{\\\"level\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Understands various diseases, their symptoms and their complications\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Understands HIV/AIDS transmission, treatment care and support-Understands tuberculosis, how it spreads, its symptoms and Sputum test-Understands leprosy, its side effects, complications, regularity of treatment etc.-Understands vector borne diseases, signs, symptoms, treatment care and support-Understands various conditions leading to avoidable blindness and deafness and