s) and follow up counselling for NTEP/RNTCP-Understands suspect cases and Multi Drug Therapy (MDT) and follow up counseling for leprosy-Understands collection of blood slides , Rapid Diagnostic Test and follow up counseling for vector borne diseases-Understands preventive measures, various services provided under NPPCD and NPCB&VI and possible complications post rehabilitation treatment-Understands treatment of various NCDs, their complications, follow up counselling and NCD Card-Understands signs and symptoms of various oral diseases, pre referal treatment and preventive measures-Understands screening of various iodine deficiency disorders, preventive measures and testing of salt for iodine level-Understands various services provided under national mental health program and recording and mentainance of data\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग को समझना\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग को समझना\"},{\"level\":\"3\",\"name\":\"Conducts contact tracing and screening\",\"description\":\"Conducts pre and post screening and and follow up counselling and maintain a compilation of records for NACP-Conducts contact tracing and create awareness for RNTCP/NTEP-Administers and monitors second dose onwards to cases refered from PHC/APHC for MDT and record of result in case card for NLEP-Collects blood slides, conducts Rapid Diagnostic Test and replenishes stocks of slides and drugs as per records for vector borne diseases-Screens and refers all suspects of blindness and deafness for appropriate treatment to higher facilities and conduct follow ups-Screens all the beneficiaries and refers the suspects of NCDs and conduct follow ups-Screens suspected cases for various oral diseases and advise primary precutionary interventions-Screens suspected cases for various iodine deficiency disorders-Screens the beneficiaries and refers the suspects of mental disorders to appropriate facilities\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग करना\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग करना\"},{\"level\":\"4\",\"name\":\"Spreads awareness among coworkers and community members\",\"description\":\"Educates coworkers and community members and support programs (eg ICTCs/ART Centers/ PPTCT Centers/ STI Clinics etc) and provide drugs as recommended by doctors for NACP-Educates community members and monitor entire treatment cycle of patients(DOTS) and record of result in the treatment card-Coordinates with ASHA to suspect cases of leprosy, follow up treatment for completion in time and counsel patients and community members-Administers doses, record results and prevention of breeding places of vectors through IEC and community mobilization-Educates community members and patients for preventive measures and services provided under NPPCD and NPCB&VI. Create awareness for eye donation in comuunity-Educates community members and patients for preventive measures, monitor treatment of patients and keep records on NCD card, prescribed reporting format of NPCDCS, NCD Application etc-Educates community members and patients for preventive measures, cessation of tobaco consumption etc-Educates community members and patients for preventive measures for iodine deficiency disorders-Educates community members and patients over importance of mental health, services provided under NMHP\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"सहकर्मियों और समुदाय के सदस्यों के बीच जागरूकता फैलाना\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"सहकर्मियों और समुदाय के सदस्यों के बीच जागरूकता फैलाना\"},{\"level\":\"5\",\"name\":\"Evaluates the condition of the patient\",\"description\":\"Assists doctors as and when required and provide referrals to clients with HIV/AIDS-Refer to higher facility in case of any complication for patients with leprosy-Refer to higher facility in case of any complication for patients with TB-Refer to higher facility in case of any complication for patients of VBD-Refers to higher facility in case of any complication in patients post r