cription\":\"Understands pre and post screening test(i.e. Rapid Test) and follow up counselling-Understands contact tracing, directly Observed Treatment (Dots) and follow up counselling for NTEP/RNTCP-Understands suspect cases and Multi Drug Therapy (MDT) and follow up counseling for leprosy-Understands collection of blood slides , Rapid Diagnostic Test and follow up counseling for vector borne diseases-Understands preventive measures, various services provided under NPPCD and NPCB&VI and possible complications post rehabilitation treatment-Understands treatment of various NCDs, their complications, follow up counselling and NCD Card-Understands signs and symptoms of various oral diseases, pre referal treatment and preventive measures-Understands screening of various iodine deficiency disorders, preventive measures and testing of salt for iodine level-Understands various services provided under national mental health program and recording and mentainance of data\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग को समझना\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग को समझना\"},{\"level\":\"3\",\"name\":\"Conducts contact tracing and screening\",\"description\":\"Conducts pre and post screening and and follow up counselling and maintain a compilation of records for NACP-Conducts contact tracing and create awareness for RNTCP/NTEP-Administers and monitors second dose onwards to cases refered from PHC/APHC for MDT and record of result in case card for NLEP-Collects blood slides, conducts Rapid Diagnostic Test and replenishes stocks of slides and drugs as per records for vector borne diseases-Screens and refers all suspects of blindness and deafness for appropriate treatment to higher facilities and conduct follow ups-Screens all the beneficiaries and refers the suspects of NCDs and conduct follow ups-Screens suspected cases for various oral diseases and advise primary precutionary interventions-Screens suspected cases for various iodine deficiency di