ethods and frequency) and community based assessment checklist\\n-Understands signs of healthy mouth changes in various age groups, common oral diseases (including Fluorosis), emergency conditions and various side effects of tobaco consuption\\n-Understands various iodine deficinency disorders, importance of cunsumption of iodised salt\\n-Understands importance of mental health, common mental disorders\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"विभिन्न बीमारियों, उनके लक्षणों और उनकी जटिलताओं को समझती है\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"विभिन्न बीमारियों, उनके लक्षणों और उनकी जटिलताओं को समझती है\"},{\"level\":\"2\",\"name\":\"Understands contact tracing and screening\",\"description\":\"Understands pre and post screening test(i.e. Rapid Test) and follow up counselling\\n-Understands contact tracing, directly Observed Treatment (Dots) and follow up counselling for NTEP/RNTCP\\n-Understands suspect cases and Multi Drug Therapy (MDT) and follow up counseling for leprosy\\n-Understands collection of blood slides , Rapid Diagnostic Test and follow up counseling for vector borne diseases\\n-Understands preventive measures, various services provided under NPPCD and NPCB&VI and possible complications post rehabilitation treatment\\n-Understands treatment of various NCDs, theircomplications, follow up counselling and NCD Card\\n-Understands signs and symptoms of various oral diseases, pre referal treatment and preventive measures\\n-Understands screening of various iodine deficiency disorders, preventive measures and testing of salt for iodine level\\n-Understands various services provided under national mental health program and recording and mentainance of data\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग को समझती है\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग को समझती है\"},{\"level\":\"3\",\"name\":\"Conducts contact tracing and screening\",\"description\":\"Conducts pre and post screening and and follow up counselling and maintain a compilation of records for NACP\\n-Ensures availability of equipments  required for diagnosing disease conditions.\\n- Manages special clinics organized for specific conditions.\\n-Plans for strategy in prevention and control of diseases.\\n-Conducts contact tracing and create awareness for RNTCP/NTEP\\n-Ensures the continuity of therapeutic regimen by the clients.\\n-Manages disease conditions as per protocols.\\n-Administers and monitors second dose onwards to cases refered from PHC/APHC for MDT and record of result in case card for NLEP\\n-Collects blood slides, conducts Rapid Diagnostic Test and replenishes stocks of slides and drugs as per records for vector borne diseases\\n-Screens and refers all suspects of blindness and deafness for appropriate treatment to higher facilities and conduct follow ups\\n-Screens all the beneficiaries and refers the suspects of NCDs and conduct follow ups\\n-Screens suspected cases for various oral diseases and advise primary precutionary interventions\\n-Screens suspected cases for various iodine deficiency disorders\\n-Screens the beneficiaries and refers the suspects of mental disorders to appropriate facilities\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग करती है\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"कान्टैक्ट ट्रेसिंग और स्क्रीनिंग करती है\"},{\"level\":\"4\",\"name\":\"Spreads awareness among coworkers and community members\",\"description\":\"Educates coworkers and community members and support programs (eg ICTCs/ART Centers/ PPTCT Centers/ STI Clinics etc) and provide drugs as recommended by doctors for NACP\\n-Educates community members and monitor entire treatment cycle of patients(DOTS) and record of result in the treatment card\\n-Coordinates with ASHA to suspect cases of leprosy, follow up treatment for completion in time and counsel patients and community members\\n-Administers doses, record results and prevention of breeding places of vectors through IEC and community mobilization\\n-Educates community members and patients for preventive measures and 