rips\\n-Understands Danger signs\\n-Knows about the Dietary Advice that should be provided to PW\\n-Knows about the Medication Advice that should be provided to PW\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"एएनसी की जांच जानती है \",\"lang-hi-description\":\"एएनसी की जांच जानती है \"},{\"level\":\"4\",\"name\":\"Conducts ANC assessment and provides ANC interventions\",\"description\":\"Conducts obstetric checkup of the woman as per protocol\\n-Asks for LMP, GPLA, medical, surgical and family history \\n-Perform the physical examination to be done during ANC like BP,temperature, pallor, edema and per abdomen  \\n -performs the tests to be done during pregnancy like Hb, urine , blood group, HIVetc\\n-Administers inj Td , IFA, calcium, albendazole during pregnancy\\n-Calculates EDD\\n-Assesses danger signs \\n-Provides Dietry Advice to PW\\n-Provides Medication Advice to PW\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"एएनसी की जांच करती है और एएनसी हस्तक्षेप प्रदान करती है\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"एएनसी की जांच करती है और एएनसी हस्तक्षेप प्रदान करती है\"},{\"level\":\"5\",\"name\":\"Identifies HRP based on assessment and refers them\",\"description\":\"Identifies ANC which qualify as HRP based on history, examination, investigations and refers them to higher centre\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"जांच के आधार पर HRP की पहचान करती है और उन्हें रेफर करती है\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"जांच के आधार पर HRP की पहचान करती है और उन्हें रेफर करती है\"}]","raw":"\"[{\\\"level\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Understands health of males and females and initial assessment protocols\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Understands  the  anatomy/physiology  of  male reproductive, sexual health\\\\n-Understands the female reproductive, sexual, menstrual and ovulatory health\\\\n-Understands  initial  assessment  protocols  for PW during ANC\\\\n-Understands  HRP  identification  and  protocol for tracking\\\",\\\"lang-hi-name\\\":\\\"पुरुषों और महिलाओं के स्वास्थ्य और प्रारंभिक जांच प्रोटोकॉल को समझती है\\\",\\\"lang-hi-description\\\":\\\"पुरुषो