h system in India and the health care delivery system\",\"description\":\"Remembers the organsation and administration of health system in India (central, state and district)\\n-Remembers the health care delivery system (health care concept and trens)\\n-Remembers the health care services (public sector, rural and urban)\\n-Remembers private sector health, PPP, AYUSH, voluntary health services, National health programs and the nurses role in health care services\\n-Remembers health planning in india (national health planning, 5 year plans, health committees and reports and NHP\\n-Remembers the various internation health agencies\\n-Remembers the various national agencies\\n-Remembers the Indian council for child welfare, FP association of India and other NGOs\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"भारत में स्वास्थ्य प्रणाली और स्वास्थ्य देखभाल वितरण प्रणाली को याद करती है\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"भारत में स्वास्थ्य प्रणाली और स्वास्थ्य देखभाल वितरण प्रणाली को याद करती है\"},{\"level\":\"2\",\"name\":\"Understands specialised community health services and the major health problems in India\",\"description\":\"Understands the different  specialised community health services and nurses role (RCH, NHM, JSSK, emergency ambulance services)\\n-Understands government health insurance schemes, school health services, occupational health nursing, geriatric nursing, care of differently abled and rehabilitation nursing\\n-Understands the major health problems in India (communicable diseases, non-communicable, nutritional problems, environmental sanitation and population)\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"भारत में विशिष्ट सामुदायिक स्वास्थ्य सेवाओं और प्रमुख स्वास्थ्य समस्याओं को समझती है\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"भारत में विशिष्ट सामुदायिक स्वास्थ्य सेवाओं और प्रमुख स्वास्थ्य समस्याओं को समझती है\"},{\"level\":\"3\",\"name\":\"Recognises the concept of health and demography and the national family welfare programmes\",\"description\":\"Recognises the concept of demography (concept, trends, fertility and infertility and small family norm)\\n-Recognises family welfare (concept, importance, aims and objectives, FP methods and FP counselling\\n-Recognises the National family welfare policy\\n-Recognises the national familu welfare programme\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"स्वास्थ्य और जनसांख्यिकी और राष्ट्रीय परिवार कल्याण कार्यक्रमों की अवधारणा को मान्यता देती है\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"स्वास्थ्य और जनसांख्यिकी और राष्ट्रीय परिवार कल्याण कार्यक्रमों की अवधारणा को मान्यता देती है\"},{\"level\":\"4\",\"name\":\"Interprets role of nursing at different levels and uses of health information systems\",\"description\":\"Interprets the role of nursing personnel at various levels (District PHN officer, Block health nurse, PHN, LHV/health supervisor and helath worker female/ANM\\n-Interprets vital statistics of helath information systems and various rates and indicators\\n-Develop strategies to provide care to specialised community health services\\n-Interprets basic statistical methods and descriptive methods\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"विभिन्न स्तरों पर नर्सिंग की भूमिका और स्वास्थ्य सूचना प्रणालियों के उपयोग की व्याख्या करती है\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"विभिन्न स्तरों पर नर्सिंग की भूमिका और स्वास्थ्य सूचना प्रणालियों के उपयोग की व्याख्या करती है\"},{\"level\":\"5\",\"name\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"lang-hi-name\":\"\",\"lang-hi-description\":\"\"}]","raw":"\"[{\\\"level\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Remembers the health system in India and the health care delivery system\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Remembers the organsation and administration of health system in India (central, state and district)\\\\n-Remembers the health care delivery system (health care concept and trens)\\\\n-Remembers the health care services (public sector, rural and urban)\\\\n-Remembers private sector health, PPP, AYUSH, voluntary health services, National health programs and the nurses role in health care services\\\\n-Remembers health planning in india (national health planning, 5 year plans, health comm