      {\n                            id: 248,\n                            type: \"Competency\",\n                            name: \"National Health Programs\",\n                            description: \"Conducts screening and creates awareness about various National Health Programs\",\n                            additionalProperties: {\n                                CompentencyType: \"\",\n                                CompetencyArea: \"\",\n                                Code: \"ME29\",\n                                subject: \"Community Health Nursing \",\n                                \"subject-hi-name\": \"सामुदायिक स्वास्थ्य नर्सिंग \",\n                                \"lang-hi-name\": \"राष्ट्रीय स्वास्थ्य कार्यक्रम\",\n                                \"lang-hi-description\": \"राष्ट्रीय स्वास्थ्य कार्यक्रम\",\n                                competencyLevelDescription: \"[{\\\"level\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Understands various diseases, their symptoms and their complications\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Understands HIV/AIDS transmission, treatment care and support\\\\n-Understands tuberculosis, how it spreads, its symptoms and Sputum test\\\\n-Understands leprosy, its side effects, complications, regularity of treatment etc.\\\\n-Understands vector borne diseases, signs, symptoms, treatment care and support\\\\n-Understands various conditions leading to avoidable blindness and deafness and screening methods\\\\n-Understands various non Communicable diseases (NCDs), their screening (beneficiaries, methods and frequency) and community based assessment checklist\\\\n-Understands signs of healthy mouth changes in various age groups, common oral diseases (including Fluorosis), emergency conditions and various side effects of tobaco consuption\\\\n-Understands various iodine deficinency disorders, importance of cunsumption of iodised salt\\\\n-Understands importance of mental health, common mental disorders\\\",\\\"lang-hi-name\\\":\\\"विभिन्न बी