ises the patient prior to transportaion (including neonates)\\\",\\\"lang-hi-name\\\":\\\"रोगी, परिचारकों (परिवार के सदस्यों) को सलाह देती है और रोगी को स्थिर करती है\\\",\\\"lang-hi-description\\\":\\\"रोगी, परिचारकों (परिवार के सदस्यों) को सलाह देती है और रोगी को स्थिर करती है\\\"},{\\\"level\\\":\\\"5\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Refers patients to higher facility\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Refers the patient to appropriate facility by using the free of cost referral transportation provided by the Government.\\\\n-Communicates to the client and family members about neonate transportation\\\\n- Providing proper documentation and reports as pre-referral management procedure.\\\\n- Ensure the medical support including the life support equipments and essential drugs during the transportation with proper and appropriate instructions to the family members and EMT’s\\\\n-Organises referral of the client to the appropriate facility\\\\n-Manages back referrals                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \\\",\\\"lang-hi-name\\\":\\\"रोगियों को उच्च स्वास्थ्य केंद्र रेफर करती है\\\",\\\"lang-hi-description\\\":\\\"रोगियों को उच्च स्वास्थ्य केंद्र रेफर करती है\\\"}]\"\n                            },\n                            \"status\": \"UNVERIFIED\",\n                            \"source\": null,\n                            \"level\": \"INITIATE\",\n                            \"levelId\": 0,\n                            \"isActive\": true,\n                            \"createdDate\": 1684317638000,\n                            \"createdBy\": \"authToken\",\n                            \"updatedDate\": 1682315811000,\n                            \"updatedBy\": \"authToken\",\n                            \"reviewedDate\": null,\n                            \"reviewedBy\": null,\n       